171	        // bounded buffer + drain pair and wired the buffer's `AuditSink` into `CedarAuthorizer`;
172	        // here we spawn the drain that persists buffered denials to Postgres out of band, on the
173	        // same shutdown-watch as the HTTP/gRPC server tasks (mirroring the reload block above).
174	        // `take_denial_drain` hands the drain out exactly once — this is the sole caller — so a
