/// `event_outbox` retention (SMA-469) — the knobs for
/// [`PgOutboxMaintainer`](crate::adapters::persistence::PgOutboxMaintainer), the background
/// sweep that bounds the outbox's growth. Nests under `[outbox]` exactly as
